cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this ontology or software, please cite it as below."
title: "KOSHA OHS Ontology (한국 산업안전보건 온톨로지)"
abstract: >-
  An ontology and reference architecture for photo-based occupational-safety
  hazard diagnosis: situational hazard patterns (SHE), safety requirements (SR),
  norm statements and legal articles, penalty paths, KOSHA guides, and a hazard
  code vocabulary. It bridges open-world Vision-LLM observations to closed-world
  OWL/SWRL/SHACL reasoning materialized into PostgreSQL for millisecond serving.
type: dataset
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-14"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jinbless/arch-bot"
keywords:
  - occupational safety and health
  - ontology
  - OWL
  - SWRL
  - SHACL
  - SKOS
  - knowledge graph
  - KOSHA
